    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d112-a2">

                <pb facs="0284" n="237" sameAs="frus:frus1981-88v13/pg237"/>


                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#bold">Proposed Revised Text of Paragraph 8 of Draft
                            Agreement<anchor n="4" xml:id="d112-f1"/>
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1982-04-13T18:30:00-05:00"
                            notBefore="1982-04-12T20:00:00+01:00">Undated</date>
                    </dateline></opener>
                <p>December 31, 1982, will conclude the interim period and, during this period, the
                    signatories shall negotiate the conditions of the decolonization and definitive
                    status of the islands, consistent with the purposes and principles of the UN Charter, United Nations General Assembly
                    Resolution 1514 (XV), and the 1964 Report of the Special Committee of the
                    General Assembly on the situation with regard to the implementation of the
                    declaration on the granting of independence to colonial countries and
                        peoples.<anchor n="5" xml:id="d112-f2"/>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
